## Layout naming (snake_case)

| Prefix | Usage |
|--------|-------|
| `fragment_` | Screen layouts |
| `activity_` | Activities |
| `item_` | RecyclerView rows |
| `dialog_` | Dialogs |
| `bottom_sheet_` | Bottom sheets |
| `layout_` | Reusable include blocks |

Example: `fragment_home.xml`, `item_language.xml`

## View ID naming (prefix + camelCase)

| Prefix | Widget |
|--------|--------|
| `mb` | MaterialButton |
| `mtv` | MaterialTextView |
| `mcv` | MaterialCardView |
| `cl` | ConstraintLayout |
| `rcv` | RecyclerView |
| `fcv` | FragmentContainerView |

Pattern: `{prefix}{Role}{Context}` → `mtvHeadingHome`, `mbContinueLogin`

## Drawable naming

| Prefix | Usage |
|--------|-------|
| `ic_svg_` | Vector icons |
| `ic_png_` | Raster icons |
| `bg_` | Backgrounds / selectors |
| `img_svg_` / `img_png_` | Large illustrations |

## Strings

- No hardcoded user-facing text in layouts or Kotlin
- Patterns: `toast_*`, `action_*`, `{screen}_title`, `{feature}_*`
- Non-translatable config: `translatable="false"`
- Shared strings in `:core-ui` module

## Colors and themes

- Material 3 DayNight theme as base
- Semantic color names: `colorPrimary`, `bodyTextColor`
- Prefer theme attributes in layouts: `?attr/colorSurface`
- Light/dark via `values` + `values-night` — avoid duplicating full layouts

## Layout rules

- ConstraintLayout as primary layout engine
- Material components (`MaterialButton`, `MaterialCardView`, etc.)
- RecyclerView: `ListAdapter` + `DiffUtil`, inflate via View Binding
- Shared styles in core-ui — reuse over one-off attributes
- `dp` for layout, `sp` for text
